# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Slide Producer — Image Backend Configuration
# 图片生成 backend 配置
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# This file lists supported image generation backends for Step 7A
# (Image Render). It is optional — current process environment
# variables take precedence. If neither runtime native image tools
# nor any of these keys are available, the pipeline auto-switches
# to HTML path (html-takeover mode) and saves Image Prompts for
# later regeneration. See SKILL.md §Output Mode 探测时机.
#
# 本文件列出 Step 7A（图片渲染）支持的 backend。是可选的——当前进程
# 环境变量优先。若 runtime 既无原生 image tool 也无下列任一密钥，
# 管线会自动切到 HTML 路径（html-takeover），并保留 Image Prompts
# 以便后续接入 backend 后续生成。详见 SKILL.md §Output Mode 探测时机。
#
# Resolution order for scripts/generate_images.py load_env() (first file
# wins; keys NOT merged; process env overrides file via setdefault):
#   1. ./.env in current working directory (cwd)
#   2. <project-dir>/.env
#   3. <skill-root>/.env  (this directory: skills/ai-slide-producer/)
#   4. ~/.ai-slide-producer/.env (global user-level configuration)
# 查找顺序（generate_images.py；只读第一个存在的 .env）：
#   1. 运行命令时的当前目录 ./.env
#   2. 项目目录 <project>/.env
#   3. skill 根目录 ai-slide-producer/.env
#   4. 用户主目录 ~/.ai-slide-producer/.env

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Active backend (required when using non-native image generation)
# 当前启用 backend（使用非原生图片生成时必填）
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMAGE_BACKEND=openai
#
# v1.0 core tier: openai / gemini
# Use IMAGE_BACKEND=none only in generated manifests for staged prompts;
# do not set it in .env for production image generation.
# Extended (works but not in core test matrix):
#   qwen / zhipu / volcengine / minimax / stability / bfl /
#   ideogram / siliconflow / fal / replicate / openrouter / modelscope

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Example: OpenAI (recommended)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMAGE_BACKEND=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxx
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-image-2
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# Proxy must be OpenAI-compatible and include /v1 (script calls
# {OPENAI_BASE_URL}/images/generations). Example proxy:
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://your-gateway.example.com/v1
#
# Some gateways (e.g. laogouapi) also offer async Jobs (NOT used by
# generate_images.py v1; sync /images/generations is enough for smoke tests):
#   POST {OPENAI_BASE_URL}/images/jobs/generations
#   POST {OPENAI_BASE_URL}/images/jobs/edits
#   GET  {OPENAI_BASE_URL}/images/jobs/{job_id}
# See references/09-image-renderer.md §OpenAI 兼容网关：同步 vs 异步 Jobs
# Allowed: png / jpeg / webp
# OPENAI_OUTPUT_FORMAT=png
# jpeg/webp only, 0-100
# OPENAI_OUTPUT_COMPRESSION=80
# gpt-image-2: auto / opaque (transparent NOT supported by gpt-image-2)
# OPENAI_BACKGROUND=auto
# auto / low
# OPENAI_MODERATION=auto

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Example: Google Nano Banana (Gemini Image API)
# Get a key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMAGE_BACKEND=nanobanana
# NANOBANANA_API_KEY=your-google-ai-studio-api-key
# Nano Banana 2 (default, fast):
# NANOBANANA_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview
# Aliases: nano-banana-2 | nano-banana-pro | nano-banana
# NANOBANANA_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com
#
# Legacy id (same API, uses GEMINI_* only):
# IMAGE_BACKEND=gemini
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview
# GEMINI_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Extended backends (uncomment one IMAGE_BACKEND line + matching keys)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# QWEN_API_KEY=your-dashscope-key
# QWEN_MODEL=qwen-image-2.0-pro
# QWEN_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/api/v1/services/aigc/text2image/image-synthesis
#
# ZHIPU_API_KEY=your-zhipu-key
# ZHIPU_MODEL=glm-image
# ZHIPU_BASE_URL=https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4/images/generations
#
# VOLCENGINE_API_KEY=your-volcengine-key
# VOLCENGINE_MODEL=doubao-seedream-4-5-251128
# VOLCENGINE_BASE_URL=https://operator.las.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v1/images/generations
#
# MINIMAX_API_KEY=your-minimax-key
# MINIMAX_MODEL=image-01
# MINIMAX_BASE_URL=https://api.minimaxi.com/v1/image_generation
#
# STABILITY_API_KEY=your-stability-key
# STABILITY_MODEL=stable-image-core
#
# BFL_API_KEY=your-bfl-key
# BFL_MODEL=flux-pro-1.1-ultra
#
# IDEOGRAM_API_KEY=your-ideogram-key
# IDEOGRAM_MODEL=ideogram-v3
#
# SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=your-siliconflow-key
# SILICONFLOW_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen-Image
#
# FAL_KEY=your-fal-key
# FAL_MODEL=fal-ai/imagen3/fast
#
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=r8_xxx
# REPLICATE_MODEL=black-forest-labs/flux-1.1-pro
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-xxx
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=google/gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Important
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# - IMAGE_API_KEY / IMAGE_MODEL / IMAGE_BASE_URL are NOT supported.
#   Use provider-specific keys only.
# - When multiple providers' keys are present, IMAGE_BACKEND MUST
#   explicitly select the active one — there is no auto-pick.
# - Current process environment wins over this file.
